# EMF/MWE2 codegen byproducts for the six datadictionary/dataflowdiagram model bundles.
# The mwe2 generator (now run automatically by each bundle's own generate-sources phase)
# always recreates a legacy PDE plugin scaffold alongside the real target/generated-sources
# output; that scaffold isn't used by the plain-Maven build and shouldn't be committed.
bundles/org.dataflowanalysis.dfd.datadictionary*/plugin.xml
bundles/org.dataflowanalysis.dfd.datadictionary*/plugin.properties
bundles/org.dataflowanalysis.dfd.datadictionary*/build.properties
bundles/org.dataflowanalysis.dfd.datadictionary*/META-INF/
bundles/org.dataflowanalysis.dfd.datadictionary*/icons/
bundles/org.dataflowanalysis.dfd.dataflowdiagram*/plugin.xml
bundles/org.dataflowanalysis.dfd.dataflowdiagram*/plugin.properties
